{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:ee8f56168155a95348e731c166dbf3fc489fab17b46b6cc0a08830bc6502c702","grain":"paper-statement","id":"An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026#cor:polynomial-multiplication","title":"Exact convolution and polynomial multiplication"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/c65981cc1f531773c6abba04.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Corollary","generation_id":"sha256:fda4c3462963b650c538e2177794811eb1c221b267efea4b091fd6e397533f81","id":"r:An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026:cor:polynomial-multiplication","kind":"statement-detail","manuscript_id":"p:An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026","name":"Exact convolution and polynomial multiplication","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","printed_number":"1.3","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","binding":{"file":"build/sections/introduction.tex","label":"cor:polynomial-multiplication","line":103,"manuscript":"An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026","statement_sha256":"93c7a6338cddaaa1bc8c2cffb2bbbcc5cca60cce3950a1428561ba343ada624d"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026.html#cor:polynomial-multiplication","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:4e35a80d21425b1f0bbc43102b4394039ce9e0c9a1984ebb5fb1bc972cec7a6d","file":"preprints/An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":103,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"93c7a6338cddaaa1bc8c2cffb2bbbcc5cca60cce3950a1428561ba343ada624d","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:4e35a80d21425b1f0bbc43102b4394039ce9e0c9a1984ebb5fb1bc972cec7a6d","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-explicit-power-saving-for-the-exact-discrete-Fourier-transform-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L103"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:polynomial-multiplication}\nThere is a single deterministic algorithm which, for every positive integer\n$n$ and every $a,b\\in\\C^n$, computes the linear convolution\n\\[\n c_k=\\sum_{\\substack{0\\le r,s<n\\\\r+s=k}}a_rb_s,\n \\qquad 0\\le k\\le 2n-2.\n\\]\nEquivalently, it multiplies two complex polynomials of degree less than $n$.\nIn the exact complex field-operation, specified-root, and address cost model\nabove, with general field multiplication permitted for the pointwise products,\nthe total running time, including scalar preparation, schedule construction,\npadding, and index work, is\n\\[\n O\\!\\left(n(\\log n)^\\theta(\\log\\log n)^{4-\\theta}\\right)\n \\qquad(n\\to\\infty),\n\\]\nand hence is eventually $O(n(\\log n)^{1-10^{-13}})$.\nThis is a bilinear arithmetic algorithm, not an input-linear circuit: its\npointwise products multiply a value linear in $a$ by a value linear in $b$."}
